      "writtenOn": "2017-10-27T15:02:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If other adapters are deleting logical ports on disable I suggest we open tickets against them as adapters should not, imo, be deleting logical ports on disable; particularly if on re-enable that causes a new port ID to be generated.",
